rem Test recording control commands
rem Validates RECORDSTART and RECORDSTOP

rem Test 1: Start recording
RECORDSTART
wait 1000ms

rem Test 2: Stop recording
RECORDSTOP
wait 300ms

rem Test 3: Start and stop multiple times
RECORDSTART
wait 800ms
RECORDSTOP
wait 300ms

RECORDSTART
wait 800ms
RECORDSTOP
wait 300ms

rem Test 4: Recording with effects
RECORDSTART
effect "Sharp Pixels"
wait 500ms
effect "Soft CRT"
wait 500ms
RECORDSTOP
wait 300ms

stop
